## Precompressed copies, conditional requests, byte ranges, HEAD

$ curl -H Accept-Encoding: gzip https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 24b610a8ecbd7920
  content-encoding: gzip
  content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
  etag: "18db9cc35fbd4dda-df3-gz"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -H If-None-Match: "18db9cc35fbd4dda-53eb" https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 304 
  bareproxy-id: 33270d704e9a5d51
  etag: "18db9cc35fbd4dda-53eb"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -r 0-99 https://bareproxy.com:8443/images/plan-demo.png
HTTP/2 206 
  bareproxy-id: 7891647389817db5
  content-range: bytes 0-99/71088
  content-type: image/png
  etag: "18db927ad0ffe200-115b0"

$ curl -I https://bareproxy.com:8443/about/
