## The API behind /api/: prefix stripped, forwarded headers, request ID passed on

$ curl https://bareproxy.com:8443/api/orders?x=1
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 82fce354e8e0dc44
  content-type: application/json
  body: {"backend":"api-1","path":"/orders?x=1","host":"bareproxy.com:8443","x_forwarded_for":"127.0.0.1","x_forwarded_proto":"https","bareproxy_id":"82fce354e8e0dc44"} 

$ curl https://bareproxy.com:8443/api/orders?x=2
HTTP/2 200 
